      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "怎么讲？",
      "start": 21.25,
      "duration": 0.61,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你有没有注意到最近这半年科技圈的风向在变？以前大家天天比谁的模型参数大、谁家GPU更贵，现在好像不太一样了。",
      "start": 22.265,
      "duration": 11.799,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我跟你说，你这个直觉挺准的。现在行业里有个很明显的转向——大家从拼参数、堆算力，开始往回看了，回到效率，回到架构创新，回到端侧。",
      "start": 34.497,
      "duration": 11.407,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，就是这个感觉！最近有个事儿特别火，有个叫Om AI的公司……",
