      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你消息也挺灵通的嘛。",
      "start": 56.382,
      "duration": 3.483,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "天天刷这些，没办法。",
      "start": 60.365,
      "duration": 2.177,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，他们这个VLX模型真的有点离谱——只有30亿参数。",
      "start": 62.98,
      "duration": 6.574,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "30亿？这在现在动辄上千亿上万亿参数的时代，听起来像个玩具。",
      "start": 70.015,
      "duration": 5.312,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对啊，但问题来了，他们就是用这30亿参数，在物理世界感知任务上反超了英伟达和谷歌。",
      "start": 75.772,
      "duration": 8.882,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这就很有意思了。你注意啊，反超不是打平，是反超，而且是在物理世界感知这种任务上。你想想，物理世界感知是什么？机器人识别环境、自动驾驶判断路况、IoT设备理解周围发生了什么——这些全是实时性要求极高的场景。",
      "start": 85.128,
      "duration": 17.695,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，那你给我解释解释，它凭什么能做到这种反超？我一个外行听上去就觉得不可思议——30亿凭啥打过几千亿的？",
      "start": 103.25,
      "duration": 7.924,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，这就是范式问题。以前大家做模型，都是先在云端训练一个巨大的通用模型，然后压缩、剪枝、蒸馏，弄个小版本放到端侧去跑。这种思路本质上还是\"大的缩减版\"。",
      "start": 111.638,
      "duration": 14.3,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "就像什么呢？把一头大象压成小象？",
      "start": 126.355,
      "duration": 4.18,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个比喻粗暴但挺到位。问题是VLX不一样，它不是缩减版，是端侧原生设计——从训练的一开始就是冲着终端场景去的，架构、数据、训练目标全是重新设计的。",
      "start": 130.971,
      "duration": 15.344,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦，所以它是\"为这个场景而生\"，不是\"削足适履\"。",
      "start": 146.732,
      "duration": 4.963,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错，这个区别可太大了。就像你盖房子，一种是先盖个摩天大楼再想办法缩小，一种是一开始就按小别墅图纸打地基。VLX就是后者。",
      "start": 152.191,
      "duration": 11.537,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这对咱们普通人意味着什么呢？",
      "start": 164.14,
      "duration": 2.917,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你想啊，如果机器人、自动驾驶、IoT设备上跑的都是这种端侧原生的小模型，反应速度会快得多，隐私也更好保护——数据不用传回云端，本地就能处理。还有个很多人忽略的点，就是成本，端侧模型不需要那么贵的算力支撑，设备价格能降下来。",
      "start": 167.536,
      "duration": 20.743,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈，那以后扫地机器人是不是都能精准识别地板上那根头发丝了？",
      "start": 188.711,
      "duration": 6.966,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你还别说，真有可能。",
