        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这是什么鬼名字？vibe不是氛围、感觉的意思吗？",
      "start": 220.237,
      "duration": 6.226,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，意思就是你别管语法细节、别管函数怎么写，把你想要的东西用自然语言说出来，AI帮你生成代码。",
      "start": 226.956,
      "duration": 8.62,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦，那不就是以前咱们聊过的\"自然语言编程\"嘛，但35万人学这个还是有点夸张。",
      "start": 235.985,
      "duration": 6.618,
      "audios": {
