        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，我有个朋友以前完全不懂编程，最近天天用AI写脚本处理Excel表格，干得比他们部门那个会Python的同事还快。",
      "start": 254.286,
      "duration": 9.056,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这就对了。说白了，AI把编程从\"专业技能\"变成了\"表达能力\"。你能不能写代码，现在不取决于你懂不懂C++、会不会调bug，取决于你能不能清晰描述你想要什么。",
      "start": 263.802,
      "duration": 14.735,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太让人五味杂陈了。我以前一直觉得编程是个门槛特别高的事儿。",
      "start": 279.008,
      "duration": 6.313,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "但其实你想想，写作难道不是一样吗？写作也需要表达力，也需要清晰思考。但写作的门槛从来不是\"认字\"或者\"会用Word\"，而是\"能不能把事儿说清楚\"。编程现在也在往这个方向走。",
      "start": 285.733,
      "duration": 13.385,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_036_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那以后是不是人人都能当开发者？",
      "start": 299.563,
      "duration": 2.525,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_037_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我觉得用不了多久，代码就会变成像写作一样的基础素养。你不需要是作家，但你得会写邮件、写报告。同理，你不需要是程序员，但你得能用AI工具把工作流自动化起来。",
      "start": 302.543,
      "duration": 13.995,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_038_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那那些专业程序员会不会被冲击？",
      "start": 316.978,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_039_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
